# fold / loop (src/wasm.ts `#iteration`). The loop context of frame d (words from 640 + 176 d):
# 0 state local, 1 counter local, 2 aggregate state, 3 literal count flag, 4 the literal, 5 first
# trip (after a vector fill), 6 predicate (loop), 7 predicate function, 8 body function, 9 node,
# 10 body inlined, 11 body variant, 12 width of the state kept in locals (0 none), 13-16 carried
# previous element (flag, get node, set node, local), 17 extras, 18 19 the count operand, 20
# unroll, 21 phase, 22 copy, 23 phases, 24-28 and 29-33 the two phases (limit kind: 0 the count
# operand, 1 a constant, 2 the bound local; literal flag, literal or constant, first trip,
# copies per back edge), 34 the bound local, 35 fold, 37 body node count, 40-71 the induction
# locals + 1 by body node, 72-103 their steps, 104-167 the extras as (known constant, value or
# local), 168-175 the state words' locals.

