f4 call waul f3 pages true
sh call wasln heap
g0 add sh 4
g2x mul g0 2
gsz add g2x 1
g1 call wab f4 6 true
g2 call waul g1 gsz true
g3 call wab g2 2 true
g4 call wab3 g3 127 1 65 true
g5 call wasl g4 heap true
g6 call wab g5 11 true
g7 call wab3 g6 127 0 65 true
g8 call wasl g7 heap true
g9 call wab g8 11 true
t5 at g9 0
me rec t5 0 0 0
ex call wkexports me p10 p2 p3 nh false
esz at ex 1
t6 at ex 0
s6 rec t6 0 0 0
h1 call wab s6 7 true
h2 call waul h1 esz true
