un call wauln nfn
c0 add un hsum
csz add c0 vsum
s8 rec t8 0 0 0
k1 call wab s8 10 true
k2 call waul k1 csz true
k3 call waul k2 nfn true
k4 fold wkhelpst nh1 k3 p8 p9
t9 at k4 0
c9 at k4 1
k5 rec t9 c9 0 0
k6 fold wkcfn p10 k5 p1 p2 p4 hio
hasd ne p14 0
nd select hasd 1 0
l1 fold wkdatast nd k6 p5 p14
