ps0 rec lt0 t5 0 0 0 false 0
lim add 4096 1
ps loop wkpgo wkpst lim ps0
lt at ps 0
t6 at ps 1
npw at ps 2
perr at ps 6
z32 call z32
occ fold wkocc 32 z32 lt
zv call z256
zf call z64
zn call z64
